  "title": "United Bank Claims No. 1 Market Share in West Virginia",
  "summary": "CHARLESTON, WV – United Bank has achieved the position of No. 1 bank in the state by local deposit market share. The FDIC recently released the results of its annual survey of branch office deposits for all FDIC-insured institutions as of June 30, 2024. In West Virginia, United claimed the top deposit market share position, with $6,287,017 in deposits and 13.5% market share.",
